-- Project Payment Request (WI-IRA-MF-HOMES-PROJECT-PAYMENT-REQUEST) — page layout
--
-- Part 2 of 2. Builds the dedicated default page layout that mirrors the
-- "IRA HOMES Multifamily Project Submittal Form" JotForm (Final Installation
-- Payment Request path), section-for-section and field-for-field, the same way
-- the Project Reservation form was mirrored onto enrollments. Inherited values
-- render read-only via dotted related_fields; every fixed-option question is a
-- picklist column seeded in part 1 (20260730193659) with the form's exact
-- options. Two-column sections with per-field column placement; the Support
-- Contractor section is gated by visible_when on ia_has_support_contractor.
--
-- Idempotent: skips if a non-master layout already exists for this record type.

-- Two editable installation fields with no clean 1-hop parent source.
ALTER TABLE public.incentive_applications
